  "description": "The request completed successfully and returned information for a total of two export realms.\n\nRealm **realm-001** (NorthAmerica) defines two data elements. The first is **product_id**, displayed as \u201cProduct ID\u201d, documented as \u201cUnique identifier for the product\u201d, and does not require anonymization. The second is **batch_number**, displayed as \u201cBatch Number\u201d, documented as \u201cManufacturing batch reference\u201d, also without anonymization.\n\nRealm **realm-002** (Europe) provides three data elements. **sku** appears as \u201cSKU\u201d, with the documentation \u201cStock Keeping Unit code\u201d, and it is not anonymized. **expiry_date** is shown as \u201cExpiry Date\u201d, documented as \u201cDate when the product expires\u201d, and likewise does not need anonymization. Finally, **owner_name** is displayed as \u201cOwner Name\u201d, documented as \u201cName of the account holder\u201d, and this field must be anonymized."
